		"rankDescription":
		[
			"I felt like I saw tears.",
			"...but I had the wrong idea.",
			"I heard something change...",
			"Nothing that you fixed can save you.",
			"I'm alright now, so you don't have to be sad anymore, okay?",
			"If it wasn't witchcraft, then I don't know what it was."
		]
	},
